================================================================================
SUMMARY
================================================================================

**Problem**: HPO pipeline 3x slower than instrumentation baseline

**Root Cause**: Python bool/int inheritance bug causing train_backbone to
become integer (truthy) instead of boolean False, resulting in training full
VGG19 backbone instead of just classifier head

**Solution**: Fixed refine_space() to keep system configuration (batch_size,
image_size, amp, train_backbone) constant while allowing HPO to optimize
hyperparameters (learning_rate, momentum, epochs)

**Result**: Runtime matches instrumentation baseline (~224s for 3 epochs),
enabling accurate scheduler predictions and moldable resource optimization

**Impact**: Scheduler can now accurately predict runtimes and make informed
moldable allocation decisions for 18-25% expected cost reduction

